        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Exit Device Pull Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull plate is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Covers a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. Old Item# PDQ-429PUN\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200R Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-38-48-inch-door-pdq-4200ra\"><b>4200RA Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200V Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-38-48-inch-door-pdq-4200va\"><b>4200VA  Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull plate is used when installing a Panic Device on doors with  2-1/8\" pre drilled bore holes.  where an exterior door pull is desired for entry if the panic device is dogged. Can also be used on Non pre drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-P-02 Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Sex Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429PUN.pdf?v=1704262276\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-P-02 Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pull Plate Trim for Exit Device, PDQ 4-P-02",
                "description": "PDQ 4-P-02 Pull plate for Exit Devices. Used to cover a pre drilled bore hole. This pull plate is used when installing a Panic Device on doors with pre drilled bore holes where an exterior door pull is desired for entry if the panic device is dogged.",
